{"kode":"LOPI","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000004327","email":["corsec@logisticsplus.co.id"],"fax":"","npwp":"003.342.339.3-017.000","phone":"(021) 78833279","website":"www.logisticsplus.co.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2024-12-04T11:39:01+07:00","value":"","office":"SAV Building\nJl. Kavling Polri No. 20\nJagakarsa, Jakarta Selatan 12620, Indonesia"}],"background":"Perseroan merupakan perusahaan yang bergerak dalam bidang jasa pengurusan transportasi (Freight Forwarding) yang melayani pasar domestik dan luar negeri. Perseroan beralamat di SAV Building Jl. Kavling Polri No. 20, Jagakarsa, Jakarta Selatan 12620. Berdiri pada tahun 2013, Perseroan memulai aktivitas operasional di tahun 2016 dengan 2 unit truk, dengan total pelanggan hanya 3 perusahaan. Sampai saat ini, Perseroan terus mengembangkan usahanya hingga memiliki lebih dari 20 pelanggan dengan peningkatan armada baik milik sendiri maupun sewa.\n\nPerseroan merupakan perusahan hasil dari kerjasama antara para pengusaha Nasional yang ahli dibidang logistik/jasa pengiriman dengan anak perusahan Logisticsplus Inc yang berada di Indonesia. Atas hubungan istimewa ini menjadikan Perseroan mendapat hak istimewa untuk mempergunakan jaringan Logistics Plus Inc yang berkantor pusat di Amerika dan mempunyai kantor perwakilan di hampir 180 Negara. Pada saat Perseroan mendapatkan permintaan dari pelanggan yang ingin mengirimkan barang dari Indonesia ke luar negeri atau sebaliknya maka dapat memanfaatkan jaringan internasional tersebut. Perusahaan juga melayani pengurusan jasa kepabeanan, baik untuk tujuan ekspor maupun impor serta saat ini melayani jasa pergudangan yang meliputi: pengemasan, penyimpanan, pemilahan barang dan pelabelan.\n\nSelama bertahun-tahun Perseroan telah berpengalaman dalam melakukan berbagai macam pengiriman barang baik di dalam maupun di luar negeri serta membantu setiap kebutuhan pelanggan dalam mendistribusikan barang mereka, yang diantaranya: alat kesehatan, peralatan pengeboran minyak, peralatan pemurnian minyak, alat telekomunikasi, alat transportasi kereta, makanan, pembangkit listrik, dan juga membantu pengemasan, penyimpanan produk pelanggan, serta melayani jasa pengurusan dokumentasi bea cukai.","history":{"amount":"30 B","board":"Papan Akselerasi","date":"11 Oct 2023","price":"100","registrar":"","shares":"300,000,000","underwriters":["Elit Sukses Sekuritas"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"32.85%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[],"director":[{"id":"33618699","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-22T10:48:25+07:00","value":"BUDI MULYANA"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"33618701","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2026-06-22T10:48:25+07:00","value":"FERIANTO"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"33618700","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-06-22T10:48:25+07:00","value":"ARFINDI A. BATUBARA"}],"president_director":[{"id":"33618698","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-22T10:48:25+07:00","value":"WAHYU DWI JATMIKO"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"32.87%","name":"MASYARAKAT NON WARKAT","value":"361.56 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""}],"subsidiary":[],"profile":{"fund_type":{"value":"","info":""},"inception_date":"","fund_manager":"","fund_manager_ico":"","custodian_bank":"","custodian_ico":"","risk_level":{"value":"","info":""},"aum":{"value":"","info":""},"maxdrawdown":{"value":"","info":""},"cagr5year":{"value":"","info":""},"expense_ratio":{"value":"","info":""},"average_yield":{"value":"","info":""},"prospectus":{"name":"","file":"","dir":"","url":""},"fund_fact_sheet":[],"redemption_bank_name":"","min_buy":"","buy_fee":"","sell_fee":""},"fee":[],"asset_allocation